Papers with multiple major weaknesses undermining core contributions, missing ablations, and acknowledged metric inadequacies fall into the **clear reject** category (<3.0). The OML paper aligns with papers like Online_Fitting (2.0) in this regard, though it has somewhat better experimental variety and targeted design.

